  "section_rich_text": [
    {
      "section_id": "sec_sunny_about",
      "body_text": "The Sunny Lady runs Dolphin Cruises daily from The Wharf in Orange Beach, Alabama. Family owned and operated, this is an ideal way to enjoy a relaxing 1.5\u20132 hour cruise watching dolphins play in their natural habitat. The boat features open decks, a snack bar, restrooms, and an air-conditioned and heated cabin. Explore the intercoastal waterway where dolphins are plentiful and see marine wildlife up close \u2014 a perfect activity for the whole family."
    }
  ],
