      "section_id": "sec_sunny_reviews",
      "author_name": "Ashley Gertz",
      "rating": 5.0,
      "review_text": "My family had the best time on this dolphin cruise! The captain and team were so entertaining! They even had a big live parrot on board! We did get to see dolphins swimming around us! It was great! Also, lots of seagulls chasing our boat and kids loved this part so much!! Best time ever!",
      "review_date": null,
      "source": "page_html",
      "sort_order": 2
    },
